  "interpretation": "The ext4 OIDS helper audit closes fallback, successful same-handle settlement, and non-continuing error-policy containment. Linux v6.14 JBD2 proves that handle abort is not journal abort. ERRORS_CONT therefore retains registration, removal-only settlement, and recovery-exposure risks; failstop recovery also awaits a locked journal-flush-to-mount-failure contract. Universal ext4 all-path closure and COMMON freeze remain false."
